{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeK9oQAGVYipGusgbsS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll ask you, or go to the bank. From this page I can't tell what my current account costs me or where the money would be better. What I'm sure of is that it isn't safe to leave a big sum sitting there without asking.\n\nWhat decided it:\n- **No fee amounts.** Under \"כמה זה עולה\" it only says \"לפי התעריפון של הגורם המציע\". In other words, whatever the bank decides.\n- **The bank has to tell me.** If more than \"15,000.00 ₪\" sits in the account, the bank must send me a notice and point me to other options. That's the one thing I'll take to the clerk.\n- **The page frightened me.** It says \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\". The 250,000 ₪ guarantee is only \"הצעה\", and it doesn't cover money in the current account. We have 400,000 at the bank.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **\"חשבון עובר ושב\".** This I know, so I stayed. It says money sitting in the account doesn't always get interest. There are two fee packages, basic and extended, and the bank must offer them.\n2. **The example box.** It shows \"74,044 ₪\", with \"תשואה בשנה 5%\". Why would a current account give 5% when a line above says it doesn't always get interest? That number stuck with me and I don't believe it. I left the sliders and the chart alone.\n3. **\"שווה לעדת\" and \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\".** I read these. The supervisor is the bank supervision at Bank of Israel, which I trust.\n4. **\"מיסוי\".** Tax is already taken off the interest. That part was fine.\n5. **\"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\".** Here I got worried.\n6. **\"מה האתר לקח בחשבון\" and the terms table.** I only glanced at these. By then I was tired and stopped. I didn't open \"הצגת כל הבדיקות\" or \"הצגת כל המונחים\".\n\nI also skipped some things:\n- \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\", except one line about transferring\n- the \"הצגת החוקים והכללים\" links\n- \"הצגה כטבלה\" under the chart\n- \"מנגנון שקלי\" and the quiz box\n\n**Words and signs I didn't understand:**\n- \"קרן כספית\", \"מק\"מ\" and \"BANK-20\" / \"BANK-23\"\n- \"TXI OQ11\" and \"שאלה פתוחה\"\n- \"מזומן שקלי\" and \"הצמדה: לא צמוד\"\n- \"ריבית צמודה למדד… הריאלית\"\n- \"בשקלים של העתיד\"\n- the little \"123\" marks and the dotted underlines\n\nThe small grey writing was hard to read: the line under the title, the notes under the boxes, \"חסום…\". The whole page is dark with pale letters.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- A dark red box at the top of one screen. Red makes me back away.\n- Several locks with \"חסום\" next to them, which I didn't understand.\n- The 5% example, as I said.\n- By the sixth screen I was tired."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3821,"cache_read_input_tokens":11721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3821},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d7c8878d-0e2e-48b1-a4ab-b6405fc73842","uuid":"534d6a84-553a-41c7-b0b2-433c75d9f974","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:05:34.761Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeK9YXEpYXWb3od9zEY"}
